description:
Part of #167

With this code:

```R
f <- function() {
  lifecycle::signal_stage("superseded", "recode()", "case_match()")
}
g <- function() {
  for (i in 1:1000) {
    f()
  }  
}
bench::system_time(g())
```

Before the PR it takes around 3s; after the PR it takes around 0.5s.
